  → Core/core/common/mem_pool_allocator.h (O(1) alloc/free)

Configuration:
  → Core/core/cfg/ (config system macros)

Application:
  → Core/core/app/module_interface.h (module lifecycle)
  → Core/core/app/app_data_storage.h (service locator DI)

