[BUILD_SYSTEM]
Main CMake:
  → CMakeLists.txt (root)
  → Core/CMakeLists.txt
  → Engine/CMakeLists.txt
  → Editor/CMakeLists.txt

Build Output:
  → build/Core/core (core lib)
  → build/Engine/engine (engine lib)
  → build/Editor/editor (executable)
  → build/unit_tests (test executable)

[TESTING]
Test Suite:
  → unittests/ (all test files)
  → Build: mkdir build && cd build && cmake .. && make -j4
  → Run: ./unit_tests
  → Single: ./unit_tests --run_test=DSBitFlagsTests

