[COMMON_TASKS]
Add new System:
  1. File: Engine/systems/verb_noun_system.cpp
  2. Inherit: ecs::system_interface
  3. Register: system_factory auto-discovers

Add new ImGui Panel:
  1. File: Editor/panels/edt_name_panel.h
  2. Pattern: if (ImGui::Begin("Name")) { ... ImGui::End(); }
  3. Call: From Editor main loop

Add new Descriptor Type:
  1. File: Core/core/desc/name_desc.h
  2. Inherit: descriptor_base or json_serializable
  3. Register: res_manager type mapping

Load Resource:
  1. Tag: res::tag{"path/to/asset"}
  2. Load: res_mgr.load<T>(tag)
  3. Wait: Optional .then(callback) for async

Create Entity:
  1. Source: Prefab template (.desc file)
  2. Spawn: world.instantiate(prefab_desc)
  3. Edit: Inspector or in-scene gizmo

[CONFIG_REFERENCE]
Editor Config File:
  → Editor/config/editor.cfg
  → Override: --set key=value CLI args
  → Variables: CFG_VAR_DEF_* macros
